{"4734960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Curse of the Night", "steam_appid": 4734960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/6338f9bf5506804573fb2bca500b5244.poster.avif?t=1779250652\" width=1170 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/6338f9bf5506804573fb2bca500b5244.webm?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/6338f9bf5506804573fb2bca500b5244.mp4?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Cursed Worlds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curse of the Night is a fast-paced 3D co-op action roguelite for <strong>1–4 players</strong> where you clear cursed rooms, fight waves of monsters, collect scrolls, abilities, and equippable loot, and decide when to extract before the curse becomes too strong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/3be2cb97df1ab9c1eab5ae49665cbd7e.poster.avif?t=1779250652\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/3be2cb97df1ab9c1eab5ae49665cbd7e.webm?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/3be2cb97df1ab9c1eab5ae49665cbd7e.mp4?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each fight starts a timer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay in combat, the stronger the enemies become. Push deeper through 1–20 rooms for better rewards, or leave through the portal before you lose what you carried. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/21c82864f202c8a7b8cfff53930be0b4.poster.avif?t=1779250652\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/21c82864f202c8a7b8cfff53930be0b4.webm?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/21c82864f202c8a7b8cfff53930be0b4.mp4?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extract, or Risk Everything</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract through the portal and bring your loot back to the hub, or stay longer for better rewards and face deadlier enemies. If you die before extracting, you lose what you carried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the stronger your build can become. But greed can cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/45a9e67260cfd22daaead7d0ca90eee7.poster.avif?t=1779250652\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/45a9e67260cfd22daaead7d0ca90eee7.webm?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/45a9e67260cfd22daaead7d0ca90eee7.mp4?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Broken Magic Combos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover scrolls, abilities, relics, and trophies that change the way you fight. Mix elemental powers, stack strange synergies, and turn your character into a walking storm of unstable magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on damage, survivability, support, crowd control, or chaotic combinations that should probably not exist.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/d1ddc0ba876458b271a882aca625ea36.poster.avif?t=1779250652\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/d1ddc0ba876458b271a882aca625ea36.webm?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/d1ddc0ba876458b271a882aca625ea36.mp4?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot, Equip, Upgrade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and equip loot of different rarities, each with its own stats and bonuses. Some items can increase your damage, improve survivability, strengthen specific abilities, or push your build in a completely new direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every piece of gear matters. Choose what to equip, what to carry, and what is worth risking before the next fight begins.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/a2fa96ad7170da0efd923f4a6dd7e0f4.poster.avif?t=1779250652\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/a2fa96ad7170da0efd923f4a6dd7e0f4.webm?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/a2fa96ad7170da0efd923f4a6dd7e0f4.mp4?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Together</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with up to three friends in online co-op. Coordinate builds, cover each other during chaotic fights, and adapt when the cursed worlds throw stronger enemies, bosses, and unexpected threats at your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/cd2a9b5c4c3cd400825a7ee1c1879e5b.poster.avif?t=1779250652\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/cd2a9b5c4c3cd400825a7ee1c1879e5b.webm?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/cd2a9b5c4c3cd400825a7ee1c1879e5b.mp4?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared Hub Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you bring back matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saved resources can be used to upgrade your hub, strengthen future expeditions, and help your team go deeper next time. Extract safely, build long-term progress, and prepare for harder runs.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/ac7607bf12cadb7615c1c3e9b227489c.poster.avif?t=1779250652\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/ac7607bf12cadb7615c1c3e9b227489c.webm?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/ac7607bf12cadb7615c1c3e9b227489c.mp4?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Cursed Night</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay too long, and the world becomes far more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cursed Night brings stronger enemies, deadlier bosses, and a true test of your build, teamwork, and greed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every scroll is a choice.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every item is a risk.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every portal is a temptation.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every death is a lesson.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/9e683933f6d147f8804c9937aede64ba.poster.avif?t=1779250652\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/9e683933f6d147f8804c9937aede64ba.webm?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/9e683933f6d147f8804c9937aede64ba.mp4?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/6338f9bf5506804573fb2bca500b5244.poster.avif?t=1779250652\" width=1170 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/6338f9bf5506804573fb2bca500b5244.webm?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/6338f9bf5506804573fb2bca500b5244.mp4?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Cursed Worlds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curse of the Night is a fast-pa