eadlier enemies. If you die before extracting, you lose what you carried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the stronger your build can become. But greed can cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/45a9e67260cfd22daaead7d0ca90eee7.poster.avif?t=1779250652\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/45a9e67260cfd22daaead7d0ca90eee7.webm?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/45a9e67260cfd22daaead7d0ca90eee7.mp4?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Broken Magic Combos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover scrolls, abilities, relics, and trophies that change the way you fight. Mix elemental powers, stack strange synergies, and turn your character into a walking storm of unstable magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on damage, survivability, support, crowd control, or chaotic combinations that should probably not exist.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/d1ddc0ba876458b271a882aca625ea36.poster.avif?t=1779250652\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/d1ddc0ba876458b271a882aca625ea36.webm?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/d1ddc0ba876458b271a882aca625ea36.mp4?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot, Equip, Upgrade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and equip loot of different rarities, each with its own stats and bonuses. Some items can increase your damage, improve survivability, strengthen specific abilities, or push your build in a completely new direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every piece of gear matters. Choose what to equip, what to carry, and what is worth risking before the next fight begins.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/a2fa96ad7170da0efd923f4a6dd7e0f4.poster.avif?t=1779250652\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/a2fa96ad7170da0efd923f4a6dd7e0f4.webm?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/a2fa96ad7170da0efd923f4a6dd7e0f4.mp4?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Together</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with up to three friends in online co-op. Coordinate builds, cover each other during chaotic fights, and adapt when the cursed worlds throw stronger enemies, bosses, and unexpected threats at your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/cd2a9b5c4c3cd400825a7ee1c1879e5b.poster.avif?t=1779250652\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/cd2a9b5c4c3cd400825a7ee1c1879e5b.webm?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734960/extras/cd2a9b5c4c3cd400825a7ee1c1879e5b.mp4?t=1779250652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >